# Source art kept out of the repo on purpose.
#
# parts/_icons_full is 30 MB of 1024x1024 originals and parts/_cards_full
# another 27 MB. What the game loads is parts/icons at 128x128, 680 KB for all
# twenty-two. This is a public repo on free GitHub Pages, so pushing the
# originals would put 56 MB into the history permanently, make the source art
# public, and slow every clone, to ship files the game never requests.
#
# The originals live on Jordan's machine. If they ever need to be shared, they
# want a release or a drive, not the page that serves the game.
parts/_icons_full/
parts/_cards_full/
parts/_alt/
parts/_icons_preview.png
parts/_make_kit.py
